            "review_title": "Review at Phu Yen Street Foods | Hai San & Ca Nuong Phu Yen",
            "review_text": "Lily\n2 contributions\n0\nGreat Fried Rice and Chicken!\nJul 2026 • Solo\nI had the fried rice with chicken, and it was really tasty. The fried rice was flavorful, and the chicken was tender and well-cooked. The portion size was satisfying, and the food was served fresh. The restaurant was clean, and the atmosphere was comfortable. I enjoyed my meal.Thank you so much!\nWritten July 9, 2026\nSZK\nThank you very much for your wonderful review!\n\nWe are delighted to hear that you enjoyed our fried rice with chicken, the fresh flavors, generous portions, and the comfortable atmosphere. Your kind words encourage our team every day.\n\nAt Phu Yen Street Foods, we are committed to serving fresh Phu Yen seafood, charcoal-grilled specialties, and authentic Vietnamese dishes with consistent quality. We hope to welcome you again whenever you are looking for great seafood and local cuisine in Binh Thanh.\n\nThank you again for your support, and we look forward to serving you on your next visit!\nRead more\nWritten July 13, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
