            "review_text": "Wander15046763262\n2 contributions\n0\nDelicious food and great experience\nMay 2026 • Friends\nA friend recommended this restaurant to me, and I'm so glad I came. The food was fresh, flavorful, and truly memorable. It's a taste I'll definitely miss. If I return to Ho Chi Minh City, I'll be sure to enjoy again.\nWritten June 17, 2026\nSZK\nThank you very much for your wonderful review.\n\nWe are delighted to hear that you enjoyed the fresh seafood and authentic flavors of Phu Yen cuisine. It means a lot to us that your visit became a memorable part of your time in Ho Chi Minh City.\n\nWe truly appreciate your friend’s recommendation and your kind words. Our team works hard every day to bring the taste of Phu Yen to both local and international guests.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back to Phu Yen Street Foods whenever you return to Ho Chi Minh City.\n\nWarm regards,\nPhu Yen Street Foods Team\nRead more\nWritten June 18, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
